418
00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:34.850
And I went and I looked at the script for Angry Andy and it didn't say.

419
00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.670
It just said everyone gathers in the conference room.

420
00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:40.270
Did you get to pick?

421
00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:43.110
Did somebody ask you the question, table or rows?

422
00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.390
They do ask the question.

423
00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:50.290
I chose the table because I wanted it to feel more claustrophobic in the room, that people

424
00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:55.030
were more stacked next to each other, that Aaron felt a little bit more trapped.

425
00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:59.870
I also wanted it to make more sense that Andy doesn't see impotence on the whiteboard

426
00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:01.950
and thinks it says importance when he walks in.

427
00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:05.010
It's there's not as much space because there's this big table in the way.

428
00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:07.690
So it's two people leading a conference.

429
00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:13.610
It's more the people are all surrounded, this table, so that when people start talking about

430
00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:17.870
crazy stuff like Phyllis's two-year-long orgasm.

