00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:26.850
And he's like, my job is nothing.

435
00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:27.370
I have nothing.

436
00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.510
I can't do anything.

437
00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:32.610
And you kind of feel like, you know, it's very stacked.

